archive-contents
  A version-1 index containing exactly the `queue' and `loc-changes'
  entries as published by GNU ELPA, in GNU's `archive-contents' shape.

Provenance
----------

The artifacts were downloaded from GNU ELPA and are redistributed here
unmodified for deterministic, network-free tests.  Their embedded copyright
and license notices are intact; both packages are free software under the
GNU General Public License, version 3 or later.

The index was extracted from the live
https://elpa.gnu.org/packages/archive-contents on 2026-10-22, keeping only
the two entries above.  `loc-changes' is vendored now so later milestone
tickets do not need the network; only `queue' is exercised by ticket #24.
